WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:09.466
A few days later, Pollyanna brought Fluffy to visit Mrs. Snow.

2
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:15.390
While they were having fun watching the cat play, Mrs. Snow suddenly remembered something important.

3
00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:22.187
"Milly is doing errands, and I meant to ask her to stop by Dr. Chilton's," Mrs. Snow said.

4
00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.958
"He prescribed a new medicine for me.

5
00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:29.465
But I can't remember the name or how many times a day to take it.

6
00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:33.611
Oh, dear! What am I going to do?"

7
00:00:33.612 --> 00:00:36.333
Pollyanna hopped up, eager to help.

8
00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:40.202
"I'd be glad to run over to his office and ask him."

9
00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:44.533
"That would be wonderful!"

10
00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:49.430
Pollyanna was happy to be outside on such a beautiful day.

11
00:00:49.431 --> 00:00:53.840
When she reached Dr. Chilton's office, he welcomed her at the door.

12
00:00:53.841 --> 00:00:58.110
"Pollyanna, your timing is perfect," Dr. Chilton said.

13
00:00:58.111 --> 00:01:02.731
"I've just seen my last patient of the day. What can I do for you?"

14
00:01:02.732 --> 00:01:07.316
"Mrs. Snow can't remember the name of the medicine you told her to buy.

15
00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:10.984
She also needs to know how often to take it."

16
00:01:10.985 --> 00:01:17.394
"Come in, and I'll write that down for her."

17
00:01:17.395 --> 00:01:22.062
Dr. Chilton beckoned Pollyanna inside and sat down at his desk.

18
00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:26.725
Pollyanna looked around the room while he wrote a note on a pad of paper.

19
00:01:26.726 --> 00:01:34.552
Besides Dr. Chilton's desk, the room contained several chairs as well as a bookcase filled with medical texts.

20
00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:40.234
Through an open door, Pollyanna spotted an examining table and a glass-front cabinet.

21
00:01:40.235 --> 00:01:44.386
It contained a microscope and a model of the human body.

22
00:01:44.387 --> 00:01:48.074
There were also a chest and a cot.

23
00:01:48.075 --> 00:01:51.861
Everything appeared neat and well-organized.

24
00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:56.389
"I've never been inside your home before," Pollyanna said.

25
00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:00.471
"This is your home as well as your office, right?"

26
00:02:00.472 --> 00:02:03.286
"Yes, but it's a poor excuse for a home.

27
00:02:03.287 --> 00:02:08.421
These are just rooms. They aren't really a home."

28
00:02:08.422 --> 00:02:11.131
Pollyanna nodded in sympathy.

29
00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:20.334
"Yes, I've heard someone say it takes a spouse's hand and heart or a child's presence to make a house a home."

30
00:02:20.335 --> 00:02:24.431
"What?" The doctor spun around in his chair.

31
00:02:24.432 --> 00:02:28.148
"That's what Mr. Pendleton told me." Pollyanna paused.

32
00:02:28.149 --> 00:02:32.102
"Why don't you get a woman's hand and heart, Dr. Chilton?

33
00:02:32.103 --> 00:02:37.113
Or maybe you'd take Jimmy Bean, if Mr. Pendleton doesn't want him.

34
00:02:37.114 --> 00:02:41.761
Jimmy's a really nice orphan, and he's willing to work too.

35
00:02:41.762 --> 00:02:46.198
But I'm not sure he made the best impression on Mr. Pendleton."

36
00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:50.903
Dr. Chilton gave a slight smile as he turned back toward his desk.

37
00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:57.141
"So Mr. Pendleton thinks it takes a spouse's hand and heart to make a home?"

38
00:02:57.142 --> 00:03:04.435
"Yes, he says his mansion is just a house too. So why don't you, Dr. Chilton?"

39
00:03:04.436 --> 00:03:06.698
"Why don't I what?"

40
00:03:06.699 --> 00:03:11.535
"Get a woman's hand and heart. Oh, I almost forgot to tell you!

41
00:03:11.536 --> 00:03:17.848
It wasn't Aunt Polly who Mr. Pendleton loved long ago, so we aren't going to live with him.

42
00:03:17.849 --> 00:03:21.477
I made a mistake when I told you it was Aunt Polly."

43
00:03:21.478 --> 00:03:28.759
Pollyanna looked anxious. "I hope you didn't tell anyone."

44
00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.259
"No, I didn't tell anyone."

45
00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:38.764
Pollyanna sighed with relief. "Oh, then it's all right.

46
00:03:38.765 --> 00:03:44.574
But you still haven't answered my question. Why don't you get a spouse?"

47
00:03:44.575 --> 00:03:53.982
Dr. Chilton was silent for a few moments before he said in a serious voice, "You can't always get a spouse just by asking."

48
00:03:53.983 --> 00:04:01.118
Pollyanna studied the doctor. "But I would think you'd be able to get one.

49
00:04:01.119 --> 00:04:05.102
Lots of women would be glad to marry you."

50
00:04:05.103 --> 00:04:09.320
Dr. Chilton raised his eyebrows and laughed.

51
00:04:09.321 --> 00:04:15.229
"I'm afraid some women aren't as confident about that as you are, young lady."

52
00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:18.707
Pollyanna's eyes widened in surprise.

53
00:04:18.708 --> 00:04:22.136
"Wait a minute! Are you like Mr. Pendleton?

54
00:04:22.137 --> 00:04:26.996
Did you try to get someone's hand and heart, and she turned you down?"

55
00:04:26.997 --> 00:04:30.776
"I'd do anything to have one particular woman's hand and heart."

56
00:04:30.777 --> 00:04:36.042
Dr. Chilton spoke so softly that Pollyanna had to strain to hear him.

57
00:04:36.043 --> 00:04:39.037
"What did you say?" she asked.

58
00:04:39.038 --> 00:04:42.537
Dr. Chilton abruptly stood up.

59
00:04:42.538 --> 00:04:45.625
"There, there, Pollyanna. Never mind about that now.

60
00:04:45.626 --> 00:04:48.829
Don't bother yourself with other people's troubles.

61
00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.781
It's time for you to run back to Mrs. Snow.

62
00:04:51.782 --> 00:04:56.304
I've written down the name of the medicine and directions for taking it.

63
00:04:56.305 --> 00:04:59.015
Was there anything else she needed?"

64
00:04:59.016 --> 00:05:01.259
Pollyanna shook her head.

65
00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:11.922
"No, sir. Thank you, sir." And she hurried back to Mrs. Snow and Fluffy.

